{"id":"15f8b03faeebed96","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-graph.md","title":"部分函数图定理","display":"thm-graph — 部分函数图定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-graph","aliases":["20-thm-graph"],"display":"thm-graph — 部分函数图定理","chapter":"2","section":"2.1.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.9；式 (2.6)；统一指标的展开","source_pdf_pages":[61],"source_printed_pages":[25],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-function]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-thm-uniformization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-graph — 部分函数图定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.9；式 (2.6)；统一指标的展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>61</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>25</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d75e4fc6653b234\" href=\"?note=5d75e4fc6653b234\" title=\"20-thm-uniformization\">20-thm-uniformization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_f=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:f(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\">\\(G_f=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:f(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\\)</span>。\n局部记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SV}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{SV}(E)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x,y,z\\,[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E\\Rightarrow y=z]\">\\(\\forall x,y,z\\,[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E\\Rightarrow y=z]\\)</span>，即配对关系单值。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5d75e4fc6653b234\" href=\"?note=5d75e4fc6653b234\" title=\"20-thm-uniformization\">20-thm-uniformization</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1\\Longleftrightarrow G_f\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists u,v:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nu,v\\text{ 全可计算},\\\\\n\\forall e\\ W_{u(e)}=G_{\\varphi_e},\\\\\n\\forall e\\ (\\operatorname{SV}(W_e)\\Rightarrow G_{\\varphi_{v(e)}}=W_e)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1\\Longleftrightarrow G_f\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists u,v:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nu,v\\text{ 全可计算},\\\\\n\\forall e\\ W_{u(e)}=G_{\\varphi_e},\\\\\n\\forall e\\ (\\operatorname{SV}(W_e)\\Rightarrow G_{\\varphi_{v(e)}}=W_e)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 编译一个域程序：输入配对码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 时，逐阶段等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(x)\">\\(\\varphi_e(x)\\)</span> 停止为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>；若停为不同值则一直不停。其域恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{\\varphi_e}\">\\(G_{\\varphi_e}\\)</span>，参数定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(e)\">\\(u(e)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 的关系码，以统一选择函数程序取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(e)\">\\(v(e)\\)</span>。若该关系单值，选择函数在所有非空截面只能输出唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，因此其整个图恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>；空截面处不停止。应用到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_f\">\\(G_f\\)</span> 就给反向。多值 c.e. 关系也有选择程序，但其图通常是原关系的真子集，不能省略 SV 条件。两个索引转换器本身对所有自然数全定义，不承诺任意 c.e. 关系都是函数图。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 25 / PDF 61。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-uniformization","status":"resolved","id":"5d75e4fc6653b234","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-uniformization]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-uniformization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-uniformization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-uniformization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-uniformization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-uniformization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-uniformization","status":"resolved","id":"5d75e4fc6653b234","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-uniformization]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G_f=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:f(x)\\downarrow=y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SV}(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x,y,z\\,[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E\\Rightarrow y=z]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1\\Longleftrightarrow G_f\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists u,v:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nu,v\\text{ 全可计算},\\\\\n\\forall e\\ W_{u(e)}=G_{\\varphi_e},\\\\\n\\forall e\\ (\\operatorname{SV}(W_e)\\Rightarrow G_{\\varphi_{v(e)}}=W_e)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(x)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"G_{\\varphi_e}","display":false},{"tex":"u(e)","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"v(e)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"G_f","display":false}],"bytes":2091,"backlinks":[{"id":"e010fb488b7602de","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。"},{"id":"711da376393d5bc5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"d6d2212c1bd4c3c5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"}],"outgoing":["3f7915f8f8ad037c","60af447f5d59a8dc","35073b74f84433b3","4ef1aee16db6b308","8ba6597a854c206f","5d75e4fc6653b234"]}